and finite supremum
\(\sup_{v\,\mathrm{continuous\ psh}}(E(v)-\int v\,d\mu)\) relative to a
genuine continuous semipositive reference. Merely defining this supremum
or E1 does not construct the operator. Our theorem does not solve the
nontrivial-valuation part of P16.4 and does not earn
